WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:05.000
I'm really proud of you for going on this
trip. You're going to have so much fun.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.259
Similar to the first film, similar to
Jurassic Park, that was a movie that was designed to

00:00:12.259 --> 00:00:13.609
be seen in the theater.

00:00:13.609 --> 00:00:19.110
Because there's so much spectacle involved. We 
try to design an experience that

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:23.590
was going to be conducive to large
format. I love big scope and I love the

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.950
big movies but I also want those movies to
have an intimacy and a sense of humanity

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.550
to them

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:32.169
bringing that feeling to this was my
absolute number one priority. You know

00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:34.760
the IMAX experience specifically in this,
it's a pretty

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.400
stunning experience, you really do feel the
difference

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.760
I think this is the kind of movie that
needs to be seen

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.039
in a theater you'll be able to watch
this on two-dimensional

00:00:50.039 --> 00:00:53.680
you know media through the course your
life forever on download it or watching TV

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.149
or DVD or Blu ray or something but

00:00:55.149 --> 00:00:58.260
seeing this in the theater on a 60 foot
widescreen in IMAX

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:01.699
and feeling the dinosaurs in your lap I
think it's the beauty of a movie like this

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:06.049
You just can't feel the largeness of it
when you're watching it say

00:01:06.049 --> 00:01:09.440
on your phone or even on your TV. You
just don't feel it.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.780
But when you're sitting in the theatre
watching in IMAX. I mean the sound

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.450
makes you physically vibrate. Watching
the movie

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:21.000
is like going on some kind of theme park ride.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.820
Because we wanted so many moments to
feel like a nature film you know the

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:29.010
mosasaurus, all these

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:32.450
you know Jacques Cousteau kinda moments. And I think the IMAX experience

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:33.530
specifically in this

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:36.990
in addition to the 3D is the way to go.
I think people can expect

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.400
a blast when they see this in theatres
and particularly in IMAX.

00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.000
I think people are going to  lose their minds.

